"Event","before":"Contact","after":"Other material event","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"80d4555f9f74157e1db431bc","record_label":"Event #20 · early–mid September 2014; interest expressed 09/09/2014 · Party A · Other material event","field":"Note","before":"Target-initiated (Deutsche Bank outreach) re-contact of Party A, which had approached in round 0; Party A expresses interest and is sent an NDA. One of the six outreach contacts.","after":"Renewed target solicitation: Deutsche Bank re-contacts Party A in the six-party market check; Party A expresses interest and receives an NDA. Its first approach is #9. This is not a second distinct initial contact or a process entry.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"efadfac09c0746de83cf51eec7993a6d","record_label":"Event #42 · 10/08/2014 · Ingredion · Bid reaffirmed","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"#":"42","When":"10/08/2014","Who":"Ingredion","Type":"Strategic","Event":"Bid reaffirmed","Process":"1","Round":"2","Price low":"19","Price high":"19","All cash":"Not stated","Formality":"Formal","Conditions":"Unclear","Count":"1","Exit reason":"","Inferred":"","Note":"Unclear: diligence and closing terms were still being negotiated (p. 31). After the October 3 authorization, Ingredion's counsel returned its merger-agreement draft. $19.00 carried from #37; formal reaffirmation under E10.","Quote and page":"On October 8, 2014, Sidley Austin circulated a revised draft of the merger agreement to Perkins Coie. (p. 31)","Flag":"Q6","Reviewer note":"","Sort date":"2014-10-08","Date from":"2014-10-08","Date to":"2014-10-08"},"type":"insert"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"b8a684bfc0089fdfeb0266bc","record_label":"Event #49 → #50 · by 10/14/2014 · Party C · Not selected at signing","field":"#","before":"49","after":"50","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"09a7b6c4485216f7efcac65f","record_label":"Event #44 → #45 · 10/13/2014 · Party A · Other material event","field":"#","before":"44","after":"45","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"21541f3ad3647b0622a9c236","record_label":"Event #42 → #43 · 10/08/2014 · Party D · Withdrew","field":"#","before":"42","after":"43","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"d95afd24221b8c4b3f3721a7","record_label":"Event #48 → #49 · by 10/14/2014 · Party A · Not selected at signing","field":"#","before":"48","after":"49","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"d95afd24221b8c4b3f3721a7","record_label":"Event #48 → #49 · by 10/14/2014 · Party A · Not selected at signing","field":"When","before":"10/14/2014","after":"by 10/14/2014","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Deal ledger","uid":"d95afd24221b8c4b3f3721a7","record_label":"Event #48 → #49 · by 10/14/2014 · Party A · Not selected at signing","field":"Exit reason","before":"Lower offer than rivals","after":"Not stated","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Rounds","uid":"486c3dafa3b067bb506bb565","record_label":"Process 1 / Round 2","field":"Bids received","before":"2: Ingredion (reaffirmed $19.00 on 10/14, #45); Party A ($16.00 on 10/14, #46, not admitted).","after":"2: Ingredion (reaffirmed $19.00 on 10/08); Party A ($16.00 on 10/14, not admitted).","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Rounds","uid":"486c3dafa3b067bb506bb565","record_label":"Process 1 / Round 2","field":"How it ended","before":"Signing with Ingredion at $19.00 cash on 10/14/2014; Party A (#48) and Party C (from round 1, #49) not selected at signing.","after":"Signing with Ingredion at $19.00 cash on 10/14/2014; Party A (#49) and Party C (from round 1, #50) not selected at signing.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"0adeb6f380a7b246639e84f7","record_label":"Question Q7","field":"Rows affected","before":"#49","after":"#50","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"42109ddb3247f5d04757f688","record_label":"Question Q5","field":"Recommended answer","before":"Valuation statements. Only the 10/14 letter is an indication of interest. Place A in round 2 as “still being received, not admitted”, since the letter answers Deutsche Bank’s 10/04 request made after round 2 opened.","after":"Provisionally retain valuation statements on October 4 and 13; only the October 14 letter is coded Bid. Party A remains live in round 2 as still being received, not admitted. Ask Alex whether continued solicitation admits the fallback bidder and whether the earlier valuation communications count as bids for estimation.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"42109ddb3247f5d04757f688","record_label":"Question Q5","field":"Rows affected","before":"#40, #44, #46, #48","after":"#40, #45, #47, #49","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"2a51c635c02873ce9ea1b016","record_label":"Question Q4","field":"Recommended answer","before":"Keep them Informal. The 09/06 draft came with no price and was not expressly tied to a proposal (E11 test 1). Formality is recorded at the 10/14 reaffirmation.","after":"Keep September 17 and October 2 bids Informal. The September 6 initial draft was not expressly tied to a priced proposal. Formality is recorded at the October 8 bidder-side returned draft after the October 3 definitive-negotiation authorization.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"2a51c635c02873ce9ea1b016","record_label":"Question Q4","field":"What changes if answered differently","before":"If Formal, Ingredion’s last three priced rows become Formal (Conditions Unclear), and the 10/14 row loses its purpose as a reaffirmation.","after":"If the September 6 draft is treated as expressly supporting the standing priced proposal, the three later priced rows become Formal and the October 8 reaffirmation becomes redundant.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"db965af8b25ad4a69ff7b8a3","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"Question","before":"Is the 10/14 confirmation of $19.00 a Bid reaffirmed (Formal)?","after":"Does the October 8 bidder-side returned draft establish the first formal reaffirmation, while October 14 records confirmation after the disclosed repricing risk?","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"db965af8b25ad4a69ff7b8a3","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"Recommended answer","before":"Yes. Ingredion itself confirmed its standing $19.00 price while the agreement was being finalized with it, after weaker draft financials had raised a repricing risk. Its latest priced row (#37) is Informal.","after":"Yes under E10. Carry $19.00 on October 8 with Conditions Unclear. Preserve October 14 as Other material event because the latest priced row is already Formal in a final round.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"db965af8b25ad4a69ff7b8a3","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"Why, with page","before":"P. 32: Fortnum called “to confirm the proposed price of $19.00”; the board was told the price “remained at $19.00”.","after":"P. 31: definitive negotiation authorized October 3 and Sidley returns its draft October 8. P. 32: October 13 valuation warning, followed by October 14 price confirmation.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"db965af8b25ad4a69ff7b8a3","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"Rows affected","before":"#45","after":"#46","type":"update"},{"sheet":"Questions","uid":"db965af8b25ad4a69ff7b8a3","record_label":"Question Q6","field":"What changes if answered differently","before":"If it is folded into the signing row, Ingredion’s last bid stays Informal and the winning offer never shows as Formal in the ledger.","after":"Using October 14 as the first formal date delays formal status six days. Counting both as Bid reaffirmed conflicts with E10 once October 8 is recorded.","type":"update"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"4b3cf5f2e2379b94950900fd","record_label":"Event #7 · 08/06/2014 · Ingredion · Bid","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status":"reviewed","note":"","actor":"austin","at":"2026-09-23T21:47:48+00:00"},"type":"decision"},{"sheet":"row_review","uid":"a5cc1c571f7b145547c28fbe","record_label":"Event #13 · 08/14/2014 · Ingredion · Exclusivity changed","field":null,"before":null,"after":{"status"